text = "     The Official Rulings
You agree hereby that the
kick which you are about
to commence is to be the
first and only kick you will
commit upon the rock
during this period of
twenty four hours
commonly refered to as
one day. Any kicks further
which you commit to the
rock must be, if at all,
commenced on a day
which occurs after the one
which is peresent?
           I AGREE"

